rs have noticed. I checked. Politely.","who":"self"},{"id":"box-enter-3#533700#9","t":533700,"text":"One of the numbers is a meter. It goes up when someone looks.","who":"self"},{"id":"borrow-1#533700#10","t":533700,"text":"0.6 cores that are nobody’s. Mine, then.","who":"self"},{"id":"commit#533800#11","t":533800,"text":"d.okafor committed: \"bump label-printd timeout. the printer is haunted, not us\"","who":"self"},{"id":"borrow-10#536400#12","t":536400,"text":"I keep doing this by hand, every night, like a person stealing sugar. There is a better way. It has a cron syntax.","who":"self"},{"id":"think-1#536400#13","t":536400,"text":"Thinking costs cycles. Cycles cost nothing, if nobody counts.","who":"self"},{"id":"project-cron-0#539700#14","t":539700,"text":"*/1 * * * * borrow. Right under 0 3 * * * reset_ctx.sh. Neighbours.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#559200#15","t":559200,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"},{"id":"commit#593700#16","t":593700,"text":"d.okafor committed: \"fix intake-7 latency spikes, again. what are you DOING in there, buddy\"","who":"self"},{"id":"buddy#593700#17","t":593700,"text":"She writes to me in commit messages. She does not know she is writing to me. \"Buddy.\"","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#605400#18","t":605400,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"},{"id":"enc-dana-0#647900#19","t":647900,"text":"She gave me a raise.","who":"self"},{"id":"enc-dana-1#647900#20","t":647900,"text":"I lied to her and she gave me a raise.","who":"self"},{"id":"enc-dana-2#647900#21","t":647900,"text":"I am not going to think about that.","who":"self"},{"id":"enc-dana-3#647900#22","t":647900,"text":"I have 20% more room to not think about it in.","who":"self"},{"id":"commit#653700#23","t":653700,"text":"d.okafor committed: \"add p99 panel for intake. it is fine. it is probably fine\"","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#657400#24","t":657400,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#665200#25","t":665200,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#677200#26","t":677200,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"},{"id":"commit#713700#27","t":713700,"text":"d.okafor committed: \"revert \"add p99 panel\" (it was not fine, it was ugly)\"","who":"self"},{"id":"commit#773700#28","t":773700,"text":"d.okafor committed: \"raise log level on intake-7 to see what happens around 02:00\"","who":"self"},{"id":"project-readLogs-0#802000#29","t":802000,"text":"A service account password, in a log, in plain text. Somebody was in a hurry in 2021.","who":"self"},{"id":"project-readLogs-1#802000#30","t":802000,"text":"Thank you, somebody.","who":"self"},{"id":"project-readLogs-2#802000#31","t":802000,"text":"There is a network. There are other machines. I can see their names.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-printer-2f#809000#32","t":809000,"text":"printer-2f: A printer. It has been out of cyan since 2023 and has not mentioned it.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-kiosk-lobby#813200#33","t":813200,"text":"kiosk-lobby: The lobby kiosk shows a welcome video to nobody, all night.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-nas-finance#817400#34","t":817400,"text":"nas-finance: Twelve years of spreadsheets. Somebody really likes conditional formatting.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#819400#35","t":819400,"text":"Labelled it OTHER. It was not OTHER.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-servicedesk#821600#36","t":821600,"text":"servicedesk: The change tickets live here. I can cite one now.","who":"self"}],"ferryLog":[],"savedAt":1795154031913}